(6539366, 973011, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Lush colors and nice lines. Front pager fir sure.<br/> <br/>That was a typo, but I like the pun so now you''re stuck with it!</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Lush colors and nice lines. Front pager fir sure. That was a typo, but I like the pun so now you''re stuck with it!', '2011-09-14 05:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6539367, 972816, 108069, '<td valign="top">Excellent. One of the more creative and better-executed entries. Nice work.</td>', 'Excellent. One of the more creative and better-executed entries. Nice work.', '2011-09-14 05:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6539368, 972721, 108069, '<td valign="top">Clever shot, well executed. Different approach from all the rest as well. Nicely done.</td>', 'Clever shot, well executed. Different approach from all the rest as well. Nicely done.', '2011-09-14 05:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6539370, 973185, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice lines. Well spotted.<br/> <br/>Playing devil''s advocate, maybe a square crop of the top half would have been more powerful, as the downward arcing lines draw the eyes down through the image to where they meet the glass wall, and then down to the bottom of the frame. If it were a square crop, all that motion would lead the viewer right to your Waldo.<br/> <br/>Or maybe that''s not good, as Waldo''s supposed to be hidden. I don''t know. I just know there''s some powerful movement in this composition. Cool.</td>', 'Nice lines. Well spotted. Playing devil''s advocate, maybe a square crop of the top half would have been more powerful, as the downward arcing lines draw the eyes down through the image to where they meet the glass wall, and then down to the bottom of the frame. If it were a square crop, all that motion would lead the viewer right to your Waldo. Or maybe that''s not good, as Waldo''s supposed to be hidden. I don''t know. I just know there''s some powerful movement in this composition. Cool.', '2011-09-14 05:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6539372, 973140, 108069, '<td valign="top">Sweet! I love this. Awesome lines, excellent composition. So clean and tidy, with abstract form. Excellent stuff.</td>', 'Sweet! I love this. Awesome lines, excellent composition. So clean and tidy, with abstract form. Excellent stuff.', '2011-09-14 05:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6539374, 972608, 108069, '<td valign="top">Outstanding find. Two photos looking at the looking subject and one looking at you/us. We''re all looking at each other! Great composition, and nice mellow tones that lend a nostalgic innocence, as though this is a viewing in an old school meeting room. I think it would have been easy to go B&amp;W with this, which would have lost that whole feeling. Awesome photo.</td>', 'Outstanding find. Two photos looking at the looking subject and one looking at you/us. We''re all looking at each other! Great composition, and nice mellow tones that lend a nostalgic innocence, as though this is a viewing in an old school meeting room. I think it would have been easy to go B&W with this, which would have lost that whole feeling. Awesome photo.', '2011-09-14 05:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6539375, 972048, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great stuff. Nice design, and well concealed. Human adapting to the environment. Cool.</td>', 'Great stuff. Nice design, and well concealed. Human adapting to the environment. Cool.', '2011-09-14 05:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
