(6539782, 972436, 104230, '<td valign="top">Ha!, Nice shot, and great sky.  We stood at that same spot on Sunday afternoon trying for a similar shot, but the sky was much less interesting and besides a second, then a third, person kept appearing! Not voting.</td>', 'Ha!, Nice shot, and great sky.  We stood at that same spot on Sunday afternoon trying for a similar shot, but the sky was much less interesting and besides a second, then a third, person kept appearing! Not voting.', '2011-09-14 13:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
