(6539877, 973220, 117474, '<td valign="top">Wow! Awesome image. 9<br/>Bumped to 10. And giving you a favourite. <br/> <br/>Waldo''s appearance (or Wally''s as we call him here) in images in these challenge is mostly incidental, and adds little. Our Waldo here substantially increases the interest (certainly mine). It''s a very tough challenge to shoot a good image for. You have done really well with it.</td>', 'Wow! Awesome image. 9Bumped to 10. And giving you a favourite.  Waldo''s appearance (or Wally''s as we call him here) in images in these challenge is mostly incidental, and adds little. Our Waldo here substantially increases the interest (certainly mine). It''s a very tough challenge to shoot a good image for. You have done really well with it.', '2011-09-14 15:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
