(6541145, 973237, 16106, '<td valign="top">love what you have going here, nice use of lens flare and a fine composition. Sadly Waldo is too well hidden, I think I see her in the glare of the brightness, but there is no Aha moment, because I''m just not sure I am not seeing patterns in the hay. A bit more sharpening to get textures would have helped for me.</td>', 'love what you have going here, nice use of lens flare and a fine composition. Sadly Waldo is too well hidden, I think I see her in the glare of the brightness, but there is no Aha moment, because I''m just not sure I am not seeing patterns in the hay. A bit more sharpening to get textures would have helped for me.', '2011-09-15 17:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
