(6541292, 972442, 97225, '<td valign="top">This was the first one to come up for my vote. What a hard act to follow! I initially gave you 9, but I''ve come back to give you my only 10. There are plenty of lovely pictures (aren''t there always?) and entries where Waldo is so hard to find that it hurts my eyes trying. There are entries where Waldo is barely, or not, hidden at all, or simply of miniscule size. Then there is this. I think that you have absolutely nailed the challenge, and the photo is esthetically pleasing as well. Great job.</td>', 'This was the first one to come up for my vote. What a hard act to follow! I initially gave you 9, but I''ve come back to give you my only 10. There are plenty of lovely pictures (aren''t there always?) and entries where Waldo is so hard to find that it hurts my eyes trying. There are entries where Waldo is barely, or not, hidden at all, or simply of miniscule size. Then there is this. I think that you have absolutely nailed the challenge, and the photo is esthetically pleasing as well. Great job.', '2011-09-15 21:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541340, 973109, 64446, '<td valign="top">Clever, nicely composed... Priceless expression!</td>', 'Clever, nicely composed... Priceless expression!', '2011-09-15 22:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541350, 973360, 64446, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dream... I couldn''t spot Waldo, but it doesn''t matter - this is such a nice view to behold!</td>', 'Beautiful dream... I couldn''t spot Waldo, but it doesn''t matter - this is such a nice view to behold!', '2011-09-15 22:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
