(6541861, 973303, 108069, '<td valign="top">Excellent job framing this. It isn''t easy, I know. Love the contrast and shades and tones. Great photo.</td>', 'Excellent job framing this. It isn''t easy, I know. Love the contrast and shades and tones. Great photo.', '2011-09-16 09:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541866, 973105, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. The lines, colors, tones, shadows, illuminated bits and the touch of nice sky all work in a wonderful way. What''s particularly great is how all the movement in the photo created by all the lines and arcs leads the eye into the depths of the photo and right to Waldo. And on top of it all he''s perfectly lit. Excellent stuff. Front pager for sure.</td>', 'This is beautiful. The lines, colors, tones, shadows, illuminated bits and the touch of nice sky all work in a wonderful way. What''s particularly great is how all the movement in the photo created by all the lines and arcs leads the eye into the depths of the photo and right to Waldo. And on top of it all he''s perfectly lit. Excellent stuff. Front pager for sure.', '2011-09-16 10:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541996, 973171, 59029, '<td valign="top">No Waldo yet...unless that''s them just left of centre in the archway?</td>', 'No Waldo yet...unless that''s them just left of centre in the archway?', '2011-09-16 11:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
