(6542000, 972442, 59029, '<td valign="top">Ohhh I see him now, standing facing right, head down, left of centre.  Very clever, hopw much his arm looks like an ear of corn!</td>', 'Ohhh I see him now, standing facing right, head down, left of centre.  Very clever, hopw much his arm looks like an ear of corn!', '2011-09-16 11:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
