(6542494, 973314, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice find and a good idea. I think some adjustments would have made this even stronger. I don''t know what was behind you, but squaring up the wall would help, as would cropping out that bit of sky that''s creeping in the top right. Flare doesn''t really add to the image.<br/> <br/>It''s a great find that could be really great with just a bit more attention when snapping.</td>', 'Nice find and a good idea. I think some adjustments would have made this even stronger. I don''t know what was behind you, but squaring up the wall would help, as would cropping out that bit of sky that''s creeping in the top right. Flare doesn''t really add to the image. It''s a great find that could be really great with just a bit more attention when snapping.', '2011-09-16 20:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6542499, 973223, 108069, '<td valign="top">One of the more fun, more enjoyable images in this challenge. It''s great how he does pop out like that. The lighting is amazing. Great photo.</td>', 'One of the more fun, more enjoyable images in this challenge. It''s great how he does pop out like that. The lighting is amazing. Great photo.', '2011-09-16 20:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
