(6546694, 972922, 92953, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dtremain:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice picture. Not sure what the insects are doing. Just FYI, Waldo is a cartoon-ish character of a guy in a red &amp; white striped shirt, and a red &amp; white striped hat, carrying a walking stick. The character was popularized in a series of Where''s Waldo books, where Waldo appears in very, very, very busy and colorful drawings that (usually) include lots of people dressed in colorful outfits. If you can, check out <a href="//www.whereswaldo.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">www.whereswaldo.com</a>. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you so much for the information. This was really a wonderful explaination for me to learn. Thanks again, dtremain. Regards, Alex.</td>', 'Originally posted by dtremain: Very nice picture. Not sure what the insects are doing. Just FYI, Waldo is a cartoon-ish character of a guy in a red & white striped shirt, and a red & white striped hat, carrying a walking stick. The character was popularized in a series of Where''s Waldo books, where Waldo appears in very, very, very busy and colorful drawings that (usually) include lots of people dressed in colorful outfits. If you can, check out www.whereswaldo.com.   Thank you so much for the information. This was really a wonderful explaination for me to learn. Thanks again, dtremain. Regards, Alex.', '2011-09-21 02:22:57.000000', NULL, 0),
