(6549014, 973210, 113591, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kathy:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by timfythetoo:</b></div><hr/><i> I prefer these types of waldo images. I hate having to figure out which tiny little dot is a person. This one is fun. The person hidden in full view amongst the other "people". One of my top picks for the challenge.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I also thought that Waldo hid among people. Sorry that this didn''t place higher, but 15th is still something to be proud of. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Same here.</td>', 'Originally posted by Kathy: Originally posted by timfythetoo: I prefer these types of waldo images. I hate having to figure out which tiny little dot is a person. This one is fun. The person hidden in full view amongst the other "people". One of my top picks for the challenge.  I also thought that Waldo hid among people. Sorry that this didn''t place higher, but 15th is still something to be proud of.   Same here.', '2011-09-23 11:30:59.000000', NULL, 0);
